    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38847" root="ملت" body-key="m">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَتَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلِتَ</span></b> , (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْتٌ</span>, TA.) <i>He put</i>
[a thing] <i>in motion,</i> or <i>into a state of commotion:</i>
(ISd, K:) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَتَلَ</span>: also mentioned by IDrd,
who expresses uncertainty as to its correctness.
(TA.)

